        <p>How our Suits</p>
        <p>are Tailored.</p>
        <p>dilthough the style and shapliness Of our garments is apparent at first glance, it is the manner in which they retain their smart appearance, no matter how heavy the wear, that is the true test of our tailoring.</p>
        <p>6very garment is cut by experts, and the same careful attention is devoted to the "inside" making as is given to the more criticised outer make. anis is where our garments are superior, and why they always keep their shape. REAL HAND WOVEN : : DONEGAL VWEED SUITS 30/- to measure. LADIES' : : : : :</p>
        <p>INDIGO BLUE SERGE SUITS Guaranteed not to wear shiny, and unaffected by sun, sea, or rain.</p>
