        <p>160 160 A tie. MATCHES FOR TO-DAY. SRCON D ROUND. Orford Shed, 35, v Rylands' No. 1. iRD ROUND. C.L.C. No 1,15, v Whitecross No. 1. For. Crosfield's No. 1, 10, v Locker's No. 2, 70. Corporation, 45. v Naylor's 70. C.L.C. No. 2, 60, v County Asylum, 45. Referee, Mr. T. O'Brien. SATURDAY, JULY 207 n. 2.0 Fletcher's (Moulders), 70, v Castle Rubber, CO. Orford Shed, 35, or Rylands' No I, act, v Howley Tannery, O. Crosfield's No. 5, 65, v. P. &amp; K. No. 1, 5. St. Helens Cable No, 1, 50, v. Whitecross No. 2, 30. Referee, Mr. J. Smith. Should any of the above games be postponed on account of bad weather or any unforseen ciroumstance, the committee will re-arrange such games after the remaining games have been played.</p>
