        <p>BOTRLER GRAMMAR SCHOOL V HIILIME GRAMMAR SCHOOL.-Played at Halms on Saturday. Scores :- Boteler Grammar Schcol.-Jennings c Simcook b Nell 3, Ferguson o Davis b Simcock 1, Maginn b Simoock 0, Woodcock c and b Davis 43, Hayes o Davis b Irwin 34, Whitlow b Murphy 12, Delaney at Keys b Irwin 1, Jeffery b Nell 3, Mclntyre not out 3. Tither not out 1, extras 15; total (for eight wickets) 116. Skelton did not bat. Hulme Grammar School.-Davis run out 1, Simcock b Woodcock 2, G Caswell o Woodcock b Skelton 11, Ravald b Whitlow 19, Murphy b Skelton 0, Irwin b Woodcock 11, Keys b Whitlow 0, Neill run out 3, Banton o Hayes b Whitlow 0, F Caswell c Tither b Whitlow 0, Beck not out 0, extras 4; total 51. Sr. MARY'S V HOUGH GREEN.-Played at Hough Green on Saturday. For the winners J Price took nine wickets for stx runs. Scores :- St Mary's,-.1 J Price c Wareing b McGovern 12, .7 Mannion b McGovern 4, R Heneahan c Wiggleworth b McGovern 2, J hichardson b McGovern 3, .1 McKay b Taylor 1, R Price o Crawford b Taylor 4, J Dolan o Taylor b McGovern 0, E Moffatt o Taylor b McGovern O,J Tracey c Crawford b Taylor 2, P Gleeson not out 0, J O'Brien b Taylor 0, extras 4 ; total 32. Hough Creen-A Wareing b S J Price 0, R Taylor o Mannion b S J Price 14, T McGovern c and b 8 .7 Price 1, T Linaker c McKay b S Price 0, l Linaker o and b S J Price 0, R Go w bSJ Price 0, .7 Taylor b S J Price 0, A Crawford run out 0, T Wiggleworth b S Price 0, J Parker b S J Price 2, Dillon not out 0, extras 1 ; total 19.</p>
