        <p>, WARRINGTON SCHOOL V OLD BOYS.—Played a Padgate on Saturday. Scores : Secondary School—E II Parsons b Hodgson 2, J R Dewar b Hodgson 4, A E Evans b Hodgson 5,J Long b Hodgson 0, W Cooper b Hodgson 0, T Lightfoot b Hodgson 1, F W Simoock c Roddy b Stirrup 13 F Woodcock c arid b Malone 2, F Day b Hodgson 1, P' R 31:etiogthalnoot.out 12, C Hough c Roddy b Hodgson 0, extras Old Boys.—,l Malone at Long b Evans 4, R G Ormsby c Day b Woodcock 1, E R Hodgson b Evans 0, T Stirrup run out 4, F Roddy c Day b Evans 12. B Kelly c Day la Woodcock 2, T Groarke b Evans 0, 6 Davy lbw b Woodcock 1, H Price b Evans 3, 0 Sinclair not out 12, E Reddish b Evans 0, extras 3 ; total 32.</p>
