        <p>Sr. HELEN'S CABLE JUNIOR C.C. V VICTORIA C.C.- Played at Arpley on Tuesday. Scores :- Cable.-Mather lbw Tickle 13, Thomason run out 17, Hill c and b Tickle 0, Peel run out 3, Lampard o Finn b Tickle 0, Watson b Clough 3, Lee run out 2, Shaw not out 5, Clarke b Whelan 0, Currie b Clough 4, Darkes b Finn 1, extras 3, total 51. Victoria C.C.-Meese c and b Mather 5, Finn b Mather 0, Tivnen b Thompson 0, Edgerton b Thompson I, J Lee b Mather 1, H Clough b Mather 0, Whelan b Thompson 0, Tickle o Hill b Thompson 0, .1 Clough o Hill b Mather 0, Eckersley not out 2, extras 3, total 12 SANREY v. WHITECROSS RECREATION.-Played at Arpley. Scores:- Sankey--F Millington b Caldwell 0, J Plant lbw b Barrow I, H Porter o Lester b Barrow 1, T Whitfield c Lester b Barrow C, E Forster b Barrow 1, 0 Dickenson o 8 Caldwell b Barrow 0, E Bullen c Bennett b Barrow 0, S Bingham c Hutchinaon b Barrow 6, J Bramhall o Hutchinson b Barrow 1, H Daintith not out 3, A Corra- dine b Caldwell 0, extras 6; total 25. Whitecross-J Hallam c Forster b Millington 6. C Maybury o Whiifleld b Millington 2,'8 James b Milling- ton 1, W W Hill not out 4, J Lester b Forster 3, J Hutchinson not out 9; total (for 4 wkts.) 26.</p>
